	"data": "Production Plan: Core System on Godot\n\nDate of commitment: June 17, 2026\nDeclaration: Godot is the tool. ECS × Linked Data is the architecture. JSON-LD is the data contract. Everything from here is stable, accumulating, decoupled modules managed by a lightweight core. No more prototypes. No more stack migrations. Build.\n\nThe Lessons That Got Us Here\nMonoliths collapse. Cybernautics Studio (2019) — everything in one project, became unusable. Core (2021) — git branches + Addressables to fix it.…",
